<!-- Understanding Hearing Loss -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Early Awareness</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Understanding hearing loss at Micro Hearing</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        At first, hearing loss may begin slowly and go unnoticed. Over time, daily conversations can become tiring. Fortunately, most hearing loss cases can be managed successfully with proper care and the right hearing aids.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px;">
      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Conversations with loved ones</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Harder to follow, more tiring, and requiring repeated words.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Meetings and phone calls</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Missed words and repeated questions leading to professional strain.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Watching TV</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Turning the volume up excessively high and still missing speech clarity.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Social life</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Many people withdraw from social gatherings, which reduces confidence and quality of life.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

